 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "hook1",
   "text": "Traffic jam. Nothing has moved for an hour. Then, from the field next to you, a voice starts counting.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "hook2",
   "text": "Ten. Nine. Eight. Right next to the motorway, a rocket is about to launch. What do you do?",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong1",
   "text": "Most drivers think: front-row seats! Off the motorway, through the fence, right up to the rocket.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong2",
   "text": "Big mistake. You park right underneath it. Three. Two. One.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong3",
   "text": "Lift-off! Your car is stuck to the rocket, like chewing gum. Next stop: space. Your car is now a satellite.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong4",
   "text": "Exam failed.",
   "gap": 1.15
  },
  {
   "id": "right1",
   "text": "Here's how you do it properly.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "right2",
   "text": "Stay in your lane. Engine off. Windows up. And enjoy the show.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right3",
   "text": "Three. Two. One. Lift-off! And the whole traffic jam cheers.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right4",
   "text": "Up in the sky, the astronaut sees all of you, waiting so nicely.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right5",
   "text": "So the rocket draws a giant heart in the sky. Just for you.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right6",
   "text": "And a tiny parachute lands on your roof. A thank-you present: space ice cream.",
   "gap": 0.6
  },
  {
   "id": "right7",
   "text": "Exam passed.",
   "gap": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "outro",
   "text": "Next exam question: on the bridge, gravity switches off. Follow, so you don't miss it.",
   "gap": 1.2
  }
 ],
